	(text "Per input: 1.5 k pull-up to +4.5 V (switch wetting current) and the original 39 k + 47 pF filter, plus 68 k to ground so\nthe 3.3 V 74HC165 sees 2.8 V (open) or 0 V (closed). Connector pin to D-number order follows the original drawing: verify it.\nMemory protect (J2 pin 10) uses the same filter with the original 4.7 k pull-up and goes to RP2354B GPIO31."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
